      "title": "Agent 主链路",
      "items": [
        "utils → ai → agent → coding-agent：单向分层依赖",
        "Agent Loop 在 agent 包内，coding-agent 只负责组装与工具",
        "ModelRouter / ModelRegistry 负责模型切换与回退"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "产品与扩展",
      "items": [
        "gateway 经 AgentBridge 拉起 cornfield --mode rpc",
        "web-app / desktop 经 wire+client 连 serve 模式",
        "self-evolution 以扩展方式挂载，不侵入 Agent Loop",
        "moa-extension / cognitive-coordination（WIP）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "研发与可观测",
      "items": [
        "utils 为所有包提供 logger / dirs / CLI 底座",
        "natives ↔ crates/pi-natives（Rust · N-API）",
